om/users/qq550723504/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The retained v28 business dispatches blocked a new bounded execution: P2 had a confirmed DENIED attempt and consumed budget, while T1/T2 had no send claim. This change closes them through the existing reconciliation and trusted NOT_SENT Commands, retains the original attempts, costs, budgets and pins, and prepares candidate19/v29 with a new execution and three independent empty budgets.\n\nThe frozen proposal covers only P2 → T1 → T2 → H2A → M1A → M1B, max one attempt each and six total. P1 remains excluded; eleven survivor versions and all prior evidence/environments/backups remain. The proposed window is 2026-10-22 Singapore14:00–14:40. This preparation grants no DELETE or scheduling authority. #332 remains Draft/unmerged and #307 remains OPEN.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Actual-schema PostgreSQL closure regression:48 bounded cases, failed/invented proof rejection and same-key replay without another HEAD.\n- Real source closure and independent result review:append-only releases/revocations, one journaled exact HEAD, preserved original row multisets/pins/budgets; no DELETE.\n- Three actual native source/restore preparation groups:298 paired technical read requests, nine new backup hashes, isolated business reruns and source Core unchanged.\n- Fixed complete native entry:17 versions,41 disabled identities,9 fresh NoSuchUser,149 paired requests, source Core before=after.\n- Final cold readback:820 known CIDs stopped,21 old budgets unchanged,3 new budgets empty,57 actual backup files retained.\n- Independent source tests:8 Go packages and67 Python methods pass; one explicit Windows symlink privilege skip. Frozen packet and exact final PR HEAD CI have separate review/check receipts.\n\nAuthoritative scope is the bounded source merge contract, candidate19 packet, v29 confirmation and runbook. Blockers are limited to authorization/credential boundaries, immutable history/cost, conflicting contracts, required path/build/CI or concurrency/idempotency violations. Future hardening and full D1 acceptance are separate. No Ready, merge, old authorization reuse, cleanup, hold release or bypass is performed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:44:20Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"65d759f1ee239227d0f468ed1b4b9e193e66df8f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"qq550723504:codex/issue307-post-v22-dispatch-closure","ref":"codex/issue307-post-v22-dispatch-closure","repo":{"id":1372850950,"node_id":"R_kgDOUdQLBg","name":"data-product-platform","full_name":"qq550723504/data-product-platform","owner":{"login":"qq550723504","id":6007227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504","html_url":"https://github.com/qq550723504","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq550723504/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Go","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"watchers